timeline.body:
@cushon landed a similar change (https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/commit/01df1e5c3aaf709e9388293514ae978e59ae2cbb), but the issue was the difference between direct sources and original direct sources, so I don‘t think the issue is resolved by that commit.

This issue is blocking users from upgrading past Protobuf 3.9(?), so it would be great if we could get it merged soon.

/cc @laurentlb

